# HexChess environment (Vite). Copy to `.env.local` and fill in what you need.
# Values are inlined at build time; only `VITE_`-prefixed vars reach the app.

# ---- Room server origin (online play) ---------------------------------------
# The deployed Durable Object worker that hosts rooms. Set this for a
# production build (GitHub Pages) — without it the client dials the page's own
# host (github.io), where no room server exists. Only a bare http(s) origin is
# accepted (scheme + host, no path); the client derives wss://<host>/room/<CODE>.
#
#   VITE_ROOM_ORIGIN=https://hex-chess-rooms.<account>.workers.dev
#
# VITE_ROOM_ORIGIN=

# ---- Local multiplayer (dev) -------------------------------------------------
# Leave VITE_ROOM_ORIGIN unset in dev: `npm run dev` proxies /room to the local
# worker. Run the two commands side by side:
#
#   terminal 1:  cd worker && npx wrangler dev     # room server on :8787
#   terminal 2:  npm run dev                       # app on :5173, proxies /room
#
# Then open http://localhost:5173/#/online to create or join a room.
